Comment: 0,0:01:28.62,0:01:31.82,OPED_Translation,,0,0,0,karaoke,It’s really me!
Dialogue: 0,0:01:44.10,0:01:50.14,Default,,0,0,0,,Forty-Eighth Episode\NThe Bounty\NSapphire that Disappeared into the Sea
Dialogue: 0,0:02:44.90,0:02:45.58,Default,,0,0,0,,It's me.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:58.23,0:02:59.70,Default,,0,0,0,,Silence!
Dialogue: 0,0:03:05.09,0:03:09.30,Default,,0,0,0,,Gentlemen, if you want to make a million yen, listen up!
Dialogue: 0,0:03:09.46,0:03:10.46,Default,,0,0,0,,A million yen?
Dialogue: 0,0:03:10.72,0:03:11.72,Default,,0,0,0,,A million yen!
Dialogue: 0,0:03:12.01,0:03:13.98,Default,,0,0,0,,You know the princess of Silverland.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:14.51,0:03:15.51,Default,,0,0,0,,You mean Sapphire?
Dialogue: 0,0:03:16.15,0:03:20.92,Default,,0,0,0,,That's right. Go kidnap Sapphire. Don't kill her. Just bring her to me.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:22.28,0:03:23.58,Default,,0,0,0,,What for?
Dialogue: 0,0:03:24.63,0:03:26.81,Default,,0,0,0,,I won't answer questions.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:26.84,0:03:30.14,Default,,0,0,0,,A one-million-yen reward to whoever brings her by tomorrow morning.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:34.86,0:03:38.47,Default,,0,0,0,,Tonight, the castle's back gate is unguarded and unlocked.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:38.50,0:03:40.36,Default,,0,0,0,,Good luck, gentlemen.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:41.64,0:03:42.86,Default,,0,0,0,,Hey, a million yen!
Dialogue: 0,0:03:43.28,0:03:44.68,Default,,0,0,0,,That pays better than being pirates.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:44.84,0:03:45.35,Default,,0,0,0,,Count me in.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:03.96,0:04:05.90,Default,,0,0,0,,It's quiet... Too quiet!
Dialogue: 0,0:04:06.83,0:04:09.57,Default,,0,0,0,,On a night like this, I feel like something bad is about to happen...
Dialogue: 0,0:04:12.85,0:04:14.92,Default,,0,0,0,,Oh, Lord Sapphire, is something wrong?
Dialogue: 0,0:04:15.62,0:04:17.59,Default,,0,0,0,,Oh, it's just you, Doctor Uranai!
Dialogue: 0,0:04:17.89,0:04:19.74,Default,,0,0,0,,It is far too quiet, Lord Sapphire.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:19.96,0:04:21.58,Default,,0,0,0,,I was just thinking the same thing.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:21.93,0:04:23.48,Default,,0,0,0,,In the hallway on my way here...
Dialogue: 0,0:04:23.88,0:04:26.16,Default,,0,0,0,,Not a single guard was standing watch.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:26.61,0:04:28.23,Default,,0,0,0,,Not a single one?
Dialogue: 0,0:04:29.64,0:04:30.41,Default,,0,0,0,,Guards!
Dialogue: 0,0:04:31.21,0:04:32.36,Default,,0,0,0,,Are there no guards here?
Dialogue: 0,0:04:32.94,0:04:34.32,Default,,0,0,0,,Guards!
Dialogue: 0,0:04:40.95,0:04:41.98,Default,,0,0,0,,Will this really work?
Dialogue: 0,0:04:42.26,0:04:44.67,Default,,0,0,0,,It's my master plan. Just watch!
Dialogue: 0,0:04:51.55,0:04:53.67,Default,,0,0,0,,Looks like the bounty is ours.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:54.89,0:04:55.89,Default,,0,0,0,,Who are you?
Dialogue: 0,0:04:56.22,0:04:57.74,Default,,0,0,0,,Who are {\i1}you{\i0}, showing up after us?
Dialogue: 0,0:04:58.11,0:04:59.36,Default,,0,0,0,,Get them!
Dialogue: 0,0:05:04.82,0:05:06.66,Default,,0,0,0,,We won't let you steal our bounty!
Dialogue: 0,0:05:06.99,0:05:08.04,Default,,0,0,0,,Hurry up!
Dialogue: 0,0:05:13.19,0:05:16.06,Default,,0,0,0,,You can leave the rest to us.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:26.60,0:05:27.82,Default,,0,0,0,,She's sound asleep.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:33.54,0:05:34.62,Default,,0,0,0,,Sapphire, you're awake?
Dialogue: 0,0:05:34.64,0:05:35.55,Default,,0,0,0,,I knew you'd show up.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:35.62,0:05:36.75,Default,,0,0,0,,Who are you?
Dialogue: 0,0:05:36.93,0:05:38.88,Default,,0,0,0,,Since you're awake, we're doing this the rough way!
Dialogue: 0,0:05:41.86,0:05:43.70,Default,,0,0,0,,Just get into this sack quietly!
Dialogue: 0,0:05:47.02,0:05:49.20,Default,,0,0,0,,Blood! Is that you, Blood?
Dialogue: 0,0:05:49.59,0:05:53.54,Default,,0,0,0,,It's Boss Blood! Did you come for the bounty, too?
Dialogue: 0,0:05:57.44,0:05:59.61,Default,,0,0,0,,Boss! Trying to hog it all for yourself?
Dialogue: 0,0:05:59.79,0:06:03.41,Default,,0,0,0,,Thank you! But why are you here...? What bounty?
Dialogue: 0,0:06:21.45,0:06:23.48,Default,,0,0,0,,Give me the reward for Sapphire as promised.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:23.81,0:06:25.44,Default,,0,0,0,,It's definitely Sapphire...
Dialogue: 0,0:06:25.47,0:06:27.88,Default,,0,0,0,,Here's my one million yen reward!
Dialogue: 0,0:06:29.97,0:06:30.78,Default,,0,0,0,,Where am I?
Dialogue: 0,0:06:30.82,0:06:32.13,Default,,0,0,0,,Oh, Blood!
Dialogue: 0,0:06:32.24,0:06:34.42,Default,,0,0,0,,Wait, do you know each other?
Dialogue: 0,0:06:35.69,0:06:37.50,Default,,0,0,0,,Why did you hit me all of a sudden?
Dialogue: 0,0:06:37.70,0:06:39.30,Default,,0,0,0,,And who on earth are these people?
Dialogue: 0,0:06:42.88,0:06:46.76,Default,,0,0,0,,No way. Don't address me so casually, Princess of Silverland. It's annoying.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:47.18,0:06:48.18,Default,,0,0,0,,Blood!
Dialogue: 0,0:06:48.98,0:06:52.42,Default,,0,0,0,,Now that I've got what I came for, I'm done here. See ya.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:53.89,0:06:54.85,Default,,0,0,0,,Blood, wait!
Dialogue: 0,0:06:55.06,0:06:57.24,Default,,0,0,0,,Wait, wait—you're staying right here.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:57.34,0:06:58.03,Default,,0,0,0,,What?
Dialogue: 0,0:06:58.70,0:06:59.70,Default,,0,0,0,,What on earth is going on?
Dialogue: 0,0:06:59.90,0:07:01.03,Default,,0,0,0,,What happened?
Dialogue: 0,0:07:02.31,0:07:04.75,Default,,0,0,0,,Hang in there for three days.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:04.78,0:07:05.82,Default,,0,0,0,,Three days?
Dialogue: 0,0:07:50.64,0:07:51.86,Default,,0,0,0,,What's with this explosion?!
Dialogue: 0,0:07:55.00,0:07:56.41,Default,,0,0,0,,There's something at the bottom of the sea.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:17.38,0:09:18.38,Default,,0,0,0,,This is incredible!
Dialogue: 0,0:09:37.24,0:09:40.63,Default,,0,0,0,,Listen up, everyone! The explosion test was a success!
Dialogue: 0,0:09:42.32,0:09:44.71,Default,,0,0,0,,Transport all the finished gunpowder to
Dialogue: 0,0:09:44.74,0:09:47.82,Default,,0,0,0,,Silverland's castle town by tomorrow night!
Dialogue: 0,0:09:48.14,0:09:50.53,Default,,0,0,0,,The day after tomorrow—
Dialogue: 0,0:09:50.56,0:09:52.83,Default,,0,0,0,,the afternoon of the third day—
Dialogue: 0,0:09:52.86,0:09:55.64,Default,,0,0,0,,we'll detonate the gunpowder and blow the city of Silverland to pieces!
Dialogue: 0,0:09:56.20,0:10:00.52,Default,,0,0,0,,Now everyone, keep making more of this top-grade gunpowder!
Dialogue: 0,0:10:11.24,0:10:14.38,Default,,0,0,0,,How's that? Looks just like the real decree, doesn't it?
Dialogue: 0,0:10:15.42,0:10:17.25,Default,,0,0,0,,Anyone would take it for real.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:17.27,0:10:19.64,Default,,0,0,0,,Once this is posted, Sapphire takes all the blame!
Dialogue: 0,0:10:19.88,0:10:21.14,Default,,0,0,0,,Precisely!
Dialogue: 0,0:10:24.64,0:10:25.64,Default,,0,0,0,,What does it say?
Dialogue: 0,0:10:26.06,0:10:28.07,Default,,0,0,0,,{\i1}A grand amusement park shall be built for the children.{\i0}
Dialogue: 0,0:10:28.09,0:10:30.64,Default,,0,0,0,,{\i1}All obstructing buildings will be demolished.{\i0}
Dialogue: 0,0:10:30.66,0:10:33.44,Default,,0,0,0,,{\i1}Disobeyers will be executed immediately.{\i0}
Dialogue: 0,0:10:33.67,0:10:35.04,Default,,0,0,0,,From Princess Sapphire?!
Dialogue: 0,0:10:53.10,0:10:54.20,Default,,0,0,0,,Our homes...
Dialogue: 0,0:10:54.22,0:10:56.12,Default,,0,0,0,,How cruel...
Dialogue: 0,0:10:56.14,0:10:58.28,Default,,0,0,0,,Is this really Princess Sapphire's order?
Dialogue: 0,0:11:00.00,0:11:02.57,Default,,0,0,0,,Execution? Isn't that a bit extreme for an amusement park?
Dialogue: 0,0:11:04.67,0:11:06.82,Default,,0,0,0,,What in the world is Princess Sapphire thinking?
Dialogue: 0,0:11:41.74,0:11:42.74,Default,,0,0,0,,Sapphire!
Dialogue: 0,0:11:43.68,0:11:44.68,Default,,0,0,0,,Who's calling me?
Dialogue: 0,0:11:46.11,0:11:48.14,Default,,0,0,0,,That was definitely Blood's voice!
Dialogue: 0,0:11:49.33,0:11:50.33,Default,,0,0,0,,Quiet.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:59.46,0:12:02.12,Default,,0,0,0,,It sounds noisy outside. What's going on?
Dialogue: 0,0:12:06.66,0:12:10.24,Default,,0,0,0,,Lord Goll, this man was loitering in front of Sapphire's room.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:11.68,0:12:12.54,Default,,0,0,0,,You're...
Dialogue: 0,0:12:12.93,0:12:15.24,Default,,0,0,0,,Yep, it's me! Pirate Blood!
Dialogue: 0,0:12:17.11,0:12:18.33,Default,,0,0,0,,Whoa, boss, hold on!
Dialogue: 0,0:12:18.36,0:12:22.52,Default,,0,0,0,,Pirating wasn't paying off, so I snuck in here to change careers!
Dialogue: 0,0:12:22.86,0:12:23.86,Default,,0,0,0,,Cut me some slack!
Dialogue: 0,0:12:26.44,0:12:27.08,Default,,0,0,0,,Hey!
Dialogue: 0,0:12:27.39,0:12:28.60,Default,,0,0,0,,Bring out Sapphire!
Dialogue: 0,0:12:34.72,0:12:35.69,Default,,0,0,0,,X!
Dialogue: 0,0:12:35.90,0:12:37.76,Default,,0,0,0,,So you really are part of the X-Union!
Dialogue: 0,0:12:39.23,0:12:42.85,Default,,0,0,0,,What evil scheme are you plotting, bringing me here?!
Dialogue: 0,0:12:43.40,0:12:46.62,Default,,0,0,0,,Just as the rumors say, she's quite feisty.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:46.95,0:12:49.92,Default,,0,0,0,,Hey, Sapphire, do you know this man?
Dialogue: 0,0:12:51.26,0:12:52.17,Default,,0,0,0,,Blood!
Dialogue: 0,0:12:52.67,0:12:54.50,Default,,0,0,0,,Still, I'm glad you found this place.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:54.52,0:12:56.20,Default,,0,0,0,,I really thought you'd betrayed me.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:56.22,0:12:57.88,Default,,0,0,0,,Hey, how many times do I have to tell you?
Dialogue: 0,0:12:57.90,0:12:59.60,Default,,0,0,0,,I don't know you. You've got the wrong guy.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:01.36,0:13:05.62,Default,,0,0,0,,I can't get anything done with you butting in. Now back off! What a pain.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:07.67,0:13:08.48,Default,,0,0,0,,Blood!
Dialogue: 0,0:13:10.14,0:13:12.58,Default,,0,0,0,,I can't believe Blood would betray me after how close we were...
Dialogue: 0,0:13:13.59,0:13:14.79,Default,,0,0,0,,Something terrible is happening...
Dialogue: 0,0:13:14.81,0:13:16.61,Default,,0,0,0,,Someone! Open this door!
Dialogue: 0,0:13:17.19,0:13:18.24,Default,,0,0,0,,Let me out!
Dialogue: 0,0:13:18.94,0:13:21.39,Default,,0,0,0,,Princess of Silverland or not,
Dialogue: 0,0:13:21.41,0:13:22.71,Default,,0,0,0,,I don't care about any of that.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:22.73,0:13:24.32,Default,,0,0,0,,All I want is money.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:24.50,0:13:25.66,Default,,0,0,0,,Fine, alright.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:25.68,0:13:27.28,Default,,0,0,0,,You seem like you could be useful.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:27.30,0:13:29.88,Default,,0,0,0,,Hey, take this guy to the workshop.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:35.15,0:13:36.62,Default,,0,0,0,,Well? Learned your lesson yet?
Dialogue: 0,0:13:38.96,0:13:40.42,Default,,0,0,0,,Hey, this is crazy!
Dialogue: 0,0:13:47.88,0:13:52.07,Default,,0,0,0,,X-Union isn't naive enough to trust you.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:52.09,0:13:53.71,Default,,0,0,0,,You can stay like that all night.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:10.43,0:14:12.87,Default,,0,0,0,,This is just going too far!
Dialogue: 0,0:14:13.30,0:14:15.47,Default,,0,0,0,,I'm not listening to anything Sapphire says anymore!
Dialogue: 0,0:14:18.22,0:14:21.18,Default,,0,0,0,,Everyone! Poor people of Silverland!
Dialogue: 0,0:14:21.40,0:14:22.98,Default,,0,0,0,,You have every right to be angry!
Dialogue: 0,0:14:23.45,0:14:25.29,Default,,0,0,0,,Out of nowhere, Princess Sapphire declared
Dialogue: 0,0:14:25.32,0:14:28.71,Default,,0,0,0,,she's tearing down the castle town in three days to build
Dialogue: 0,0:14:28.74,0:14:30.86,Default,,0,0,0,, a children's amusement park here.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:30.88,0:14:32.05,Default,,0,0,0,,What's gotten into her?
Dialogue: 0,0:14:32.68,0:14:37.03,Default,,0,0,0,,But as long as Princess Sapphire's decree stands,
Dialogue: 0,0:14:37.06,0:14:39.12,Default,,0,0,0,,we must obey her orders.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:40.59,0:14:42.25,Default,,0,0,0,,What a terrible person Sapphire is!
Dialogue: 0,0:14:44.63,0:14:46.81,Default,,0,0,0,,Nylon did a fine job.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:46.83,0:14:50.80,Default,,0,0,0,,The gunpowder arrives this afternoon, and the town will be blown to bits.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:51.34,0:14:56.86,Default,,0,0,0,,And X-Union storms into a desperate Silverland.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:59.14,0:15:00.14,Default,,0,0,0,,Grand Duke Duralumin.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:01.05,0:15:03.36,Default,,0,0,0,,Well, well, Your Majesty.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:04.04,0:15:08.11,Default,,0,0,0,,Did Sapphire really order the town to be demolished?
Dialogue: 0,0:15:08.92,0:15:10.50,Default,,0,0,0,,Yes, that's right.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:10.53,0:15:14.20,Default,,0,0,0,,Apparently, she refuses to leave until construction is finished and
Dialogue: 0,0:15:14.22,0:15:16.36,Default,,0,0,0,,she's been running all over the site.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:18.61,0:15:20.14,Default,,0,0,0,,To think she'd do such a thing...
Dialogue: 0,0:15:21.58,0:15:22.93,Default,,0,0,0,,I can't believe this.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:22.95,0:15:24.12,Default,,0,0,0,,What could have happened?
Dialogue: 0,0:15:24.14,0:15:26.16,Default,,0,0,0,,Sapphire, please hurry back...
Dialogue: 0,0:15:26.18,0:15:28.96,Default,,0,0,0,,Someone! Someone open this door!
Dialogue: 0,0:15:29.44,0:15:30.88,Default,,0,0,0,,Will Silverland be alright?
Dialogue: 0,0:15:31.34,0:15:32.04,Default,,0,0,0,,Father,
Dialogue: 0,0:15:32.67,0:15:33.38,Default,,0,0,0,,Mother,
Dialogue: 0,0:15:33.77,0:15:35.80,Default,,0,0,0,,please forgive me for being so helpless.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:42.35,0:15:44.35,Default,,0,0,0,,Open the undersea tunnel!
Dialogue: 0,0:15:44.68,0:15:48.69,Default,,0,0,0,,Deliver the gunpowder to Silverland within the hour!
Dialogue: 0,0:16:16.13,0:16:17.13,Default,,0,0,0,,Let's go!
Dialogue: 0,0:16:21.06,0:16:23.28,Default,,0,0,0,,Silverland won't go down that easily!
Dialogue: 0,0:16:46.80,0:16:49.67,Default,,0,0,0,,Who threw dynamite into the room?
Dialogue: 0,0:16:51.77,0:16:53.35,Default,,0,0,0,,Sapphire, are you okay?
Dialogue: 0,0:16:56.46,0:16:57.14,Default,,0,0,0,,Blood!
Dialogue: 0,0:16:59.12,0:17:00.30,Default,,0,0,0,,You came to save me.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:00.33,0:17:01.30,Default,,0,0,0,,Of course I did.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:01.97,0:17:03.58,Default,,0,0,0,,Are you hurt, Sapphire?
Dialogue: 0,0:17:06.80,0:17:10.96,Default,,0,0,0,,X-Union is about to blow Silverland to bits with dynamite!
Dialogue: 0,0:17:11.17,0:17:11.99,Default,,0,0,0,,What?
Dialogue: 0,0:17:12.01,0:17:13.68,Default,,0,0,0,,But how do we get out of here?
Dialogue: 0,0:17:15.39,0:17:16.60,Default,,0,0,0,,Don't let Blood get away!
Dialogue: 0,0:17:16.84,0:17:18.68,Default,,0,0,0,,Feed him to the sharks!
Dialogue: 0,0:17:18.98,0:17:21.03,Default,,0,0,0,,Hurry up and search! Quick!
Dialogue: 0,0:17:21.94,0:17:22.96,Default,,0,0,0,,Over here!
Dialogue: 0,0:17:24.10,0:17:24.98,Default,,0,0,0,,Look, over there!
Dialogue: 0,0:17:25.00,0:17:26.03,Default,,0,0,0,,Sapphire is with him, too!
Dialogue: 0,0:17:26.05,0:17:26.62,Default,,0,0,0,,Get them!
Dialogue: 0,0:17:41.71,0:17:46.90,Default,,0,0,0,,So Blood was just putting on an act to uncover the X-Union's true motive!
Dialogue: 0,0:17:47.32,0:17:50.21,Default,,0,0,0,,That's right. He did it all for your sake.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:51.06,0:17:51.84,Default,,0,0,0,,Listen, Sapphire!
Dialogue: 0,0:17:51.87,0:17:55.78,Default,,0,0,0,,Take this cart straight to Silverland and stop the explosion!
Dialogue: 0,0:17:57.34,0:17:58.34,Default,,0,0,0,,Blood, what about you?
Dialogue: 0,0:17:58.72,0:18:00.06,Default,,0,0,0,,Don't worry about me.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:00.08,0:18:02.34,Default,,0,0,0,,Just save Silverland, alright?
Dialogue: 0,0:18:03.85,0:18:05.16,Default,,0,0,0,,I'm sorry, Blood.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:12.64,0:18:14.70,Default,,0,0,0,,What, you still haven't found them?
Dialogue: 0,0:18:14.73,0:18:16.02,Default,,0,0,0,,Search! Search, hurry!
Dialogue: 0,0:18:16.02,0:18:17.42,Default,,0,0,0,,Goll! Over here! Over here!
Dialogue: 0,0:18:18.61,0:18:19.34,Default,,0,0,0,,Heads up!
Dialogue: 0,0:18:20.71,0:18:22.34,Default,,0,0,0,,Hey, you so-called X-Union!
Dialogue: 0,0:18:22.92,0:18:25.66,Default,,0,0,0,,I, the great Blood, am more than enough for the likes of you!
Dialogue: 0,0:18:26.06,0:18:29.43,Default,,0,0,0,,I won't let you get your hands on Sapphire!
Dialogue: 0,0:18:29.97,0:18:31.60,Default,,0,0,0,,Come on, bring it on!
Dialogue: 0,0:18:33.91,0:18:35.72,Default,,0,0,0,,What are you doing?! Catch him, quick!
Dialogue: 0,0:18:35.94,0:18:36.94,Default,,0,0,0,,Go! Attack!
Dialogue: 0,0:18:40.08,0:18:42.61,Default,,0,0,0,,Sapphire! Run! Hurry!
Dialogue: 0,0:19:07.62,0:19:09.66,Default,,0,0,0,,Whoa, isn't that dynamite?!
Dialogue: 0,0:19:09.70,0:19:12.21,Default,,0,0,0,,Oh no! They're gonna blow up our houses with that!
Dialogue: 0,0:19:23.06,0:19:26.48,Default,,0,0,0,,Let me... Lord Nylon, the dynamite is all set.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:26.54,0:19:30.76,Default,,0,0,0,,Alright, soldiers! Light every last bit of gunpowder in town!
Dialogue: 0,0:19:49.45,0:19:51.28,Default,,0,0,0,,Look! It's Sapphire!
Dialogue: 0,0:19:53.76,0:19:54.76,Default,,0,0,0,,Get her!
Dialogue: 0,0:19:57.34,0:19:58.34,Default,,0,0,0,,Damn it!
Dialogue: 0,0:20:03.07,0:20:04.74,Default,,0,0,0,,We have to hurry, or something terrible will happen!
Dialogue: 0,0:20:30.02,0:20:32.20,Default,,0,0,0,,Ah! Sapphire is cutting the fuses!
Dialogue: 0,0:20:32.55,0:20:34.70,Default,,0,0,0,,Wait, wasn't it Sapphire who gave the signal?!
Dialogue: 0,0:20:34.96,0:20:38.60,Default,,0,0,0,,Huh? What? Sapphire... Sapphire is...
Dialogue: 0,0:20:41.53,0:20:44.07,Default,,0,0,0,,Nylon! On whose orders did you do this?!
Dialogue: 0,0:20:44.25,0:20:48.06,Default,,0,0,0,,Well, an official decree was issued in Lord Sapphire's name...
Dialogue: 0,0:20:48.29,0:20:49.58,Default,,0,0,0,,A decree from me...?
Dialogue: 0,0:20:49.83,0:20:50.46,Default,,0,0,0,,Sapphire!
Dialogue: 0,0:20:50.87,0:20:53.02,Default,,0,0,0,,Looks like you managed to prevent the explosion!
Dialogue: 0,0:20:53.84,0:20:55.76,Default,,0,0,0,,Blood! You're safe!
Dialogue: 0,0:20:56.59,0:20:57.56,Default,,0,0,0,,Of course I am!
Dialogue: 0,0:20:58.11,0:20:58.82,Default,,0,0,0,,Everyone!
Dialogue: 0,0:20:59.45,0:21:02.49,Default,,0,0,0,,Setting the explosives was the work of the X-Union!
Dialogue: 0,0:21:03.03,0:21:06.23,Default,,0,0,0,,Come on! Let's take down those X-Union bastards!
Dialogue: 0,0:21:06.64,0:21:07.11,Default,,0,0,0,,Get 'em!
Dialogue: 0,0:21:07.37,0:21:08.88,Default,,0,0,0,,Hey!
Dialogue: 0,0:21:09.89,0:21:12.64,Default,,0,0,0,,Lord Sapphire, what about me?
Dialogue: 0,0:21:13.17,0:21:15.60,Default,,0,0,0,,Stay right there until your name is cleared!
Dialogue: 0,0:21:16.44,0:21:17.84,Default,,0,0,0,,You can't be serious...
Dialogue: 0,0:21:20.64,0:21:21.64,Default,,0,0,0,,We've got trouble!
Dialogue: 0,0:21:36.72,0:21:37.98,Default,,0,0,0,,Wait! Wait! Wait!
Dialogue: 0,0:21:38.00,0:21:38.95,Default,,0,0,0,,Stop!
Dialogue: 0,0:21:39.25,0:21:40.72,Default,,0,0,0,,Come back and fight!
Dialogue: 0,0:21:40.98,0:21:41.74,Default,,0,0,0,,Damn it!
Dialogue: 0,0:21:41.91,0:21:43.16,Default,,0,0,0,,They escaped in the cart!
Dialogue: 0,0:21:56.24,0:21:56.86,Default,,0,0,0,,Damn it!
Dialogue: 0,0:21:56.89,0:21:58.83,Default,,0,0,0,,What a pathetic bunch!
Dialogue: 0,0:22:10.89,0:22:11.54,Default,,0,0,0,,Amazing!
Dialogue: 0,0:22:12.16,0:22:14.16,Default,,0,0,0,,Just look at it plow right into them, Sapphire!
Dialogue: 0,0:22:15.80,0:22:19.00,Default,,0,0,0,,What on earth happened? I don't hear the explosions anymore.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:19.15,0:22:22.97,Default,,0,0,0,,W-W-W-W-W-W-W-W-W-W-W-What is this earthquake?!
Dialogue: 0,0:22:35.32,0:22:36.72,Default,,0,0,0,,What was that earthquake just now?
Dialogue: 0,0:22:36.74,0:22:39.66,Default,,0,0,0,,An underwater explosion sank the island.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:39.69,0:22:44.82,Default,,0,0,0,,Oh, what a disaster! All our hard work, down the drain...
Dialogue: 0,0:23:03.15,0:23:04.15,Default,,0,0,0,,Lord Sapphire!
Dialogue: 0,0:23:05.07,0:23:09.77,Default,,0,0,0,,Thank you. Thanks to you, the town was spared from destruction.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:10.14,0:23:11.62,Default,,0,0,0,,It's too early to celebrate.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:12.24,0:23:14.74,Default,,0,0,0,,The X-Union is finally closing in on Silverland.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:16.09,0:23:17.15,Default,,0,0,0,,But no matter what happens everyone,
Dialogue: 0,0:23:17.17,0:23:22.43,Default,,0,0,0,,we must protect our nation, this beautiful Silverland!
Dialogue: 0,0:23:22.94,0:23:24.52,Default,,0,0,0,,Let us all join forces!
Dialogue: 0,0:23:44.51,0:23:50.82,Default,,0,0,0,,{\i1}Just as Sapphire predicted, the main force of the X-Union turned its dark fangs toward Silverland.{\i0}
